<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Thanks for reaching out! — TechNeural</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b0716;
      color: #dfdbed;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #0b0716;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #120d24;
      border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #c026d3 100%);
      padding: 44px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .content h2 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .content p {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: #dfdbed;
    }
    .details-box {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .details-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: #9d8ec2;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .details-item {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .details-item:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #c026d3 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.35);
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #72629b;
    }
    .socials {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .socials a {
      color: #7c3aed;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Thank you for contacting us!</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Hey <%= name %>,</h2>
        <p>Thanks for reaching out to TechNeural. We've received your request about <strong><%= service || 'your project' %></strong>, and a real member of our team is already looking it over.</p>
        <p>You can expect to hear back from us with some honest thoughts and recommended next steps within 24 hours.</p>
        
        <div class="details-box">
          <div class="details-title">Summary of your message:</div>
          <% if (service) { %>
            <div class="details-item"><strong>Service:</strong> <%= service %></div>
          <% } %>
          <div class="details-item" style="margin-top: 8px; font-style: italic; color: #b1a7d1;">
            "<%= message.length > 120 ? message.substring(0, 120) + '...' : message %>"
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>If you're in a hurry or want to share more assets, feel free to drop us a line on WhatsApp directly.</p>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/919193257838" class="btn" target="_blank">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> TechNeural. All rights reserved.<br>
        We build premium websites, AI automations, and growth workflows.
        <div class="socials">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/107535474/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a> &middot;
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/the.techneural/" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
